{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get To Gold is a car simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a lot of gold on the top. Drive a super car up and get it\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is simple: drive a super\u00a0 car to break through many hurdles and get a lot of gold in the air.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it is unfortunate to roll over, getting off and pushing the car will be your best choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are tired of difficulties, you can drive a super  car at full speed in the grass and forget all your troubles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603800/extras/0.jpg?t=1742705971\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603800?t=1742705971","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603800?t=1742705971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603800/8cc2642fe8df3272ecc255c68ea65ccb8c8b337a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742705971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603800/8cc2642fe8df3272ecc255c68ea65ccb8c8b337a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742705971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get To Gold is a car simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a lot of gold on the top. Drive a super car up and get it\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is simple: drive a super\u00a0 car to break through many hurdles and get a lot of gold in the air.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h